    "detailed_description": "Play as Vera, the young Shadow Empress of Bilon - a direct aide to the Empress (your sister) who not only stole your fiance, but left you doing the taxes as well! You\u2019re no push-over though: Fed up, you infiltrated the Harem of the Immortals - and will take your revenge by winning over the five male, magical creatures who reside there.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vackon Durai</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397770/extras/05abf4565d6223a92174f03408b13230.avif?t=1710349046\" /></span><br>\u201cI\u2019ve tortured bodies and souls alike - often out of duty. But your soul, I\u2019d eat it whole - for the pleasure alone.\u201d<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sairen Elilarashu</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397770/extras/90fc410af797c23e971731f582aef85e.avif?t=1710349046\" /></span><br>\u201cPeople are more inclined to give you anything through pleasure than pain. Oh, don\u2019t get me wrong, little jellyfish. A little pain is always welcome \u2665\u266a\u201d<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 Love Interests<br></li><li>Animated CGs<br></li><li>Multiple Endings<br></li><li>Secret Ending - Will you win over all the Love interests and unlock the true ending?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get a taste</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397770/extras/2c0df7d0e6b5795fd3bd144681ac3079.avif?t=1710349046\" /></span><br><br>Content is being added as we go - first we will introduce you to two of the five Love Interests (Vackon and Sairen). Eventually, you will be able to meet the Priests of the Sacred Snake Temple, the winged and playful God of Love - and explore character combinations as well.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you step into the Harem?</h2><br><br><br><i>Wishlist us and try the demo</i>",
